{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e29dbf54-d4d8-851b-b8cd-e7d491dc1a07",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T09:05:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel T. Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:03:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, good morning! How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:03:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I'm calling about a tree in one of the beach parks. Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:03:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Which park is it, hon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:03:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What? Say that again, I'm a little hard of hearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:03:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Which park? Which beach park is the tree in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:03:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, the park by Easton's Beach. There's a tree along the walking path, near the benches on the side toward the water. It's leaning over the path, pretty far. I'd say it's leaning more than it used to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it down, or is it still standing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still standing. Nothing has come down. I just don't want it to, with people walking under it. I'd like somebody to come trim it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:04:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me get that written up for the parks crew so they can take a look. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:04:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Isabel Correia. That's C-O-R-R-E-I-A. Isabel T."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:04:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thank you. And is a phone number okay in case the crew wants to confirm the spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:04:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you said that a little fast. A phone number? Yes. It's 401-555-0192."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:04:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-two. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:04:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. You'll have to forgive me, I'm calling for my mother, she's the one who walks there every morning. She noticed it first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:04:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, tell her thanks for keeping an eye out. I'll note that it's leaning toward the path by the benches on the water side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. And my aunt, she's a retired secretary, she'd tell me I'm talking too loud on the phone. She corrects my phone manner every time. Says I shout."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're doing just fine. I can hear you perfectly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:05:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So somebody will look at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:05:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it goes to the parks crew, and they'll check it out and decide on the trimming. Probably within the next week or two, with the holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:05:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or two. All right. That's fine, as long as it's on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:05:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the list. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:05:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:05:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Isabel. Happy New Year to you and your mom!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What was that? Oh, same to you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
